;
DIR - LIST FILES ON A DISK

A - List files on a disk

:A
LIST FILES ON A DISK

    DIR
    DIR DU:
    DIR NAME:
    DIR DU:filespec

DIR is the supplied Super Directory (SD 1.37) utility, also available
as SDZ. With no argument it lists files in the current drive/user area.

    DIR SIGM:
    DIR J1:*.DOC
    DIR P0:SIGMV011.LBR
    DIR HELP:

A question mark matches a filename character; an asterisk matches the
remainder of the name or extension. A DU or named directory selects the
area to examine without changing your current directory.

The listing reports file sizes, the number and total size of listed
files, and free space on the drive. Space is allocated in disk blocks;
the displayed size need not be the exact length of a file.

Private areas and privileged directory options remain restricted.

See HELP SDZ, HELP COMMANDS and HELP LDIR.
